    "detailed_description": "<h1>More games from Retrovibe</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/7f7f61daaa902ce669536cf90a5ff4c7.avif?t=1731600034\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/65dac16c8dcfb1e76d049581032023a4.avif?t=1731600034\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/98d74fbf80d114b6118bd9a0e0e398fe.avif?t=1731600034\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/23d2ecc9601f9de83c117d4e79a868ba.avif?t=1731600034\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/93c5eeacce165c209ccb50cbec5259ae.avif?t=1731600034\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/2561232a550d8fd24a30c9eb111f673c.avif?t=1731600034\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>High-speed canyon massacre: fly, crash, and adapt!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/8797a630a04d59ca7a6aed571f5f3c7b.poster.avif?t=1731600034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/8797a630a04d59ca7a6aed571f5f3c7b.webm?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/8797a630a04d59ca7a6aed571f5f3c7b.mp4?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelite racing</h2>VergeWorld is a retro-fuelled fast-paced roguelite combat racer in which you fly through procedurally generated canyons, shoot enemies, gather resources, and complete challenges.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/8570a4ac74e90f383f112d0f79102e8c.poster.avif?t=1731600034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/8570a4ac74e90f383f112d0f79102e8c.webm?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/8570a4ac74e90f383f112d0f79102e8c.mp4?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become the rebel</h2>In the distant future, on the inhospitable planet Gh2040-B, mankind engages in one thing it knows best - war. You are Nix, a rebellious member of the ruling class who wants to trigger a change in the Kingdom. Hidden behind a mask, you steal an experimental airship called Icarus and run to the edges of civilization to find and join the Revolt.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/ea803f2b606bec3509fbfccc84911fb1.poster.avif?t=1731600034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/ea803f2b606bec3509fbfccc84911fb1.webm?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/ea803f2b606bec3509fbfccc84911fb1.mp4?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Retro meets modern action</h2>Destroy your enemies, fly low to boost your engines, and reach Frontier outposts to refuel, upgrade your airship, and find the next challenge. In VergeWorld high replayability mixes with the nostalgic retro feeling of PSX-era 3D visuals, pixel art story screens, 16-bit tunes, and a synthwave soundtrack.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After Burner meets Wipeout, meets The Mandalorian, meets Mad Max<br></li><li>Procedurally generated levels and Returnal-inspired boss fights<br></li><li>High-speed combat racing with third-person view bullet hell fights<br></li><li>Airship\u2019s highly customizable arsenal <br></li><li>3 alien biomes to navigate<br></li><li>PSX-era 3D graphics with pixel art and a splash of modern inspiration<br></li><li>Nostalgic 16-bit tunes mixed with a synthwave soundtrack</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/4c8b24f9be132152348e5dc94f22b57c.poster.avif?t=1731600034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/4c8b24f9be132152348e5dc94f22b57c.webm?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/4c8b24f9be132152348e5dc94f22b57c.mp4?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Try the retro prototype</h2>VergeWorld started as a fan-made project for Amiga and Sega Genesis. Their creators are involved in the making of the PC game while still working on the full retro versions. You can download this prototype for free from this website.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/11010ee1ae24696ea32d0d2e8350f7a8.poster.avif?t=1731600034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/11010ee1ae24696ea32d0d2e8350f7a8.webm?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975790/extras/11010ee1ae24696ea32d0d2e8350f7a8.mp4?t=1731600034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>",
